Subject: [PATCH] feat(models): add native causal dspark draft model
 architecture support

- Register LLM_ARCH_DSPARK in llama-arch
- Implement llama_model_dspark with zero-copy shared weights from target model
- Auto-detect dspark sidecars in common/speculative for causal speculative unrolling
